OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fareas overnight, though an isolated
OL,7,Fshower is possible near the Kent
OL,8,Fcoast. Elsewhere, skies will remain
OL,9,Flargely clear, becoming chilly with a
OL,10,Ffew patches of mist and fog possible
OL,11,Fin the west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FPlenty of sunny spells
OL,14,Facross the region, but showers will
OL,15,Fcontinue across Kent for much of the
OL,16,Fday, perhaps spreading to other areas
OL,17,Flater in the afternoon. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
