OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCooler
OL,6,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,7,Fand showers. Showers most frequent
OL,8,Fnear the coast, though occasionally
OL,9,Fspreading inland from Sunday. Breezy
OL,10,Fat times.
